Corona Energy is perceived as actively supporting renewable energy, green gas, and net-zero initiatives. The company offers renewable electricity and carbon-neutral gas options, including biogas, to help businesses reduce their carbon footprint. They also provide energy efficiency solutions and carbon offset programs to support net-zero goals. However, some critics argue that their reliance on gas (even when carbon-neutral) may not align fully with long-term decarbonization needs.  

